1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:04,061
Our fictional campaign records one million ad impressions.

2
00:00:04,394 --> 00:00:07,938
An impression is an instance of an advertisement being served

3
00:00:07,938 --> 00:00:09,951
or shown under the measurement method.

4
00:00:10,257 --> 00:00:13,762
It does not necessarily establish unique reach or a person’s

5
00:00:13,762 --> 00:00:14,422
attention.

6
00:00:15,474 --> 00:00:19,546
Twelve thousand recorded clicks divided by one million impressions gives

7
00:00:19,546 --> 00:00:21,946
a one point two percent click-through rate.

8
00:00:22,225 --> 00:00:24,251
The arithmetic is straightforward.

9
00:00:24,585 --> 00:00:28,299
Whether that result is useful depends on the objective, format,

10
00:00:28,631 --> 00:00:30,541
audience, and measurement quality.

11
00:00:31,576 --> 00:00:35,253
Suppose there are one hundred eighty attributed qualified inquiries.

12
00:00:35,582 --> 00:00:39,973
Ask how qualification and attribution were defined, whether tracking worked,

13
00:00:40,046 --> 00:00:41,886
and what the campaign cost.

14
00:00:42,202 --> 00:00:45,633
Those counts alone do not prove commercial success or return

15
00:00:45,633 --> 00:00:46,529
on investment.

16
00:00:47,549 --> 00:00:51,031
The advertiser asks about delivery, reach, and inquiries.

17
00:00:51,364 --> 00:00:56,454
Axios management asks about bookings, product demand, forecast quality, and

18
00:00:56,454 --> 00:00:57,243
renewals.

19
00:00:57,536 --> 00:01:01,788
Those reporting systems connect, but we cannot assume all ad-delivery

20
00:01:01,788 --> 00:01:03,982
data lives inside Salesforce.

21
00:01:05,023 --> 00:01:09,218
Imagine customers buying newsletters plus events renew more often.

22
00:01:09,541 --> 00:01:13,710
Larger budgets or different customer types could explain both.

23
00:01:14,034 --> 00:01:18,825
Compare similar groups and examine alternative explanations before claiming that

24
00:01:18,825 --> 00:01:21,054
the product combination caused the renewal.

25
00:01:22,085 --> 00:01:26,701
Our advertiser considers a two hundred thousand dollar follow-on campaign.

26
00:01:26,982 --> 00:01:30,773
Renewal, upsell, and expansion can overlap.

27
00:01:31,106 --> 00:01:36,274
Accurate history supports a relevant conversation, while migration and governance

28
00:01:36,274 --> 00:01:39,472
protect that relationship knowledge for the next team member.
